   }
  },
  "about": {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "About",
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "html": "Data are <b>synthetic</b> (deterministic, index-seeded). The oncoprint matrix uses standard tokens (MUT, TRUNC, MISSENSE, INFRAME, AMP, GAIN, HOMDEL, and <code>mut;cna</code> combinations) parsed by the CanvasXpress engine; see <code>docs/science-panels.md</code>."
  }
